OL,3,GNEWSABeach road may close as high tides
OL,4,Abring flood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople travelling on routes between
OL,7,FWeymouth and Portland are being urged
OL,8,Fto make essential journeys only as
OL,9,Froads may be closed temporarily due to
OL,10,FStorm Boelo.
OL,12,FDorset Council said teams were on site
OL,13,Fmonitoring conditions on the A354
OL,14,FPortland Beach Road and the causeway,
OL,15,Fwith the highest risk of flooding due
OL,16,Fbetween 16:00 and 20:00 BST.
OL,18,FOn Friday, the road was closed for
OL,19,Fseveral hours after conditions became
OL,20,Funsafe as Storm Austen swept in.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
