OL,3,GNEWSABeach road may close as high tides
OL,4,Abring flood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency has issued
OL,7,Fseveral flood alerts for parts of
OL,8,FDorset's east and west coasts,
OL,9,Fincluding Portland Harbour, Chiswell,
OL,10,FPreston Beach in Weymouth, and
OL,11,FChristchurch Harbour, where high tides,
OL,12,Fstrong winds and large waves may cause
OL,13,Fflooding.
